  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Comprehensive Improvement of Social Rehabilitation Services in Peru</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejoramiento integral de los servicios de readaptacin social en el Per</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo del programa es contribuir a la mejora de la readaptacin social de la Poblacin Penitenciaria (POPE) en el sistema penitenciario del Per. Los Objetivos Especficos de Desarrollo (OED) son contribuir a lograr: (i) un adecuado servicio de readaptacin social de la POPE; (ii) una adecuada y suficiente cobertura de los servicios operativos o misionales institucionales en el Centro Nacional de Estudios Criminolgicos y Penitenciarios del Per (CENECP), en particular en la formacin de agentes penitenciarios; y (iii) una mejora de la prestacin de los servicios operativos o misionales del Instituto Nacional Penitenciario (INPE).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of the programme is to contribute to the improvement of the social reintegration of the Prison Population (POPE) within the penitentiary system of Peru.The Specific Development Objectives (SDOs) are to contribute to achieving: (i) an adequate social reintegration service for the POPE; (ii) adequate and sufficient coverage of institutional operational or core services at the National Center for Criminological and Penitentiary Studies of Peru (CENECP), particularly in the training of prison officers; and (iii) an improvement in the provision of operational or core services by the National Penitentiary Institute (INPE).</narrative>
  </description>
